<title>RUSSIA: Rostelekom H1 pre-tax profit 1.38 trln rbls.</title>
<headline>Rostelekom H1 pre-tax profit 1.38 trln rbls.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>    (billion roubles)	   1996	     1995</p>
<p>    Net sales		    3,184	    1,256</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   1,468		644</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     1,378		564</p>
<p>    Tax on profit		  277		225</p>
<p>    Distributed profit	   516		338</p>
<p>    Retained profit		585		  0</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name AO Mezhdugorodnoi i Mezhdunarodnoi Elektricheskoi Svyazi Rostelekom. --Jonathan Lynn, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520  </p>
<p>Figures to Russian accounting standards.</p>
<p>The rouble was 5,105 per dollar on the Moscow Interbank Currency Exchange (MICEX) on June 28. On December 29, 1995, it was 4,640, on June 30, 1995, it was 4,539 and on December 29, 1994, it was 3,550.</p>
<p>Consumer prices in June were 15.5 percent higher than at the end of December, compared with 77.8 percent in June 1995.</p>
